OL,3,GNEWSATrain attacker 'not intent on     
OL,4,Acold-blooded murder'                   
OL,6,FThe man accused of trying to kill      
OL,7,Fpassengers and staff on a moving train 
OL,8,Fdid not leave his house "intent on     
OL,9,Fcold-blooded murder", a court has      
OL,10,Fheard.                                 
OL,12,FAnthony Williams stabbed 10 passengers 
OL,13,Fon a Doncaster to London King's Cross  
OL,14,Fservice which had to make an           
OL,15,Funscheduled stop at Huntingdon in      
OL,16,FCambridgeshire on 1 November last year.
OL,18,FIn her closing speech at Cambridge     
OL,19,FCrown Court, defence barrister Gillian 
OL,20,FJones KC said to jurors Williams was a 
OL,21,F"man with a chaotic and disordered     
OL,22,Fmind".                                 
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
