OL,3,GNEWSATrain attacker 'not intent on     
OL,4,Acold-blooded murder'                   
OL,6,FThe 33-year-old, of Langford Road,     
OL,7,FPeterborough, denies 10 counts of      
OL,8,Fattempted murder.                      
